          "title": "TCM Classic Film Festival 2026 — \"The World Comes to Hollywood\"",
          "date": "Sat 5/2 + Sun 5/3",
          "time": "all day (fest runs Apr 30 – May 3)",
          "venue": "Hollywood Roosevelt + TCL Chinese, Egyptian, Hollywood Legion theatres",
          "blurb": "17th annual cinephile pilgrimage: restored 35mm prints, handprints, celebrity Q&As.",
          "description": "TCM's four-day festival of classic film — this year's theme celebrates immigrant pioneers of cinema. Includes a 75th-anniversary world-premiere restoration of Alice in Wonderland, a 90th-anniversary Modern Times, The Day the Earth Stood Still, and a Glenn Close hand-and-footprint ceremony at TCL Chinese. Passes sell out; individual tickets trickle onto resale.",
